## Referral Program

### Commission Structure

| Referral Type | Year 1 | Year 2-3 | Requirements |
|---------------|--------|----------|--------------|
| Lead Only | 10% | — | Qualified meeting |
| Influenced | 15% | — | Active involvement |
| Co-Sell | 20% | 10% | Joint selling |

### Deal Registration

| Stage | Protection | Commission Bonus |
|-------|------------|------------------|
| Registered | 90 days | +5% |
| Qualified | 180 days | Included |
| Not Registered | — | -5% |

### Referral Process

1. Submit lead via Partner Portal
2. MedSync qualifies within 5 business days
3. Assigned to MedSync sales rep
4. Regular status updates provided
5. Commission paid within 30 days of close

